<title>JAPAN: Nippon Kagaku Yakin -6mth parent forecast.</title>
<headline>Nippon Kagaku Yakin -6mth parent forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			   LATEST	    PREVIOUS	   ACTUAL</p>
